/ The run FreshAppGoesOn.test.goal resumes: Record calls Sub, Sub saves the run, and Record keeps the snapshot in
/ workspace/run.plang (a .plang file holds it signed, as the save signed it). %count% is set by the test before it calls
/ Record, never here: a Record or Sub run twice counts on from the saved count, so it shows.
Record
- set %where% = 'workspace/run.plang'
- set %name% = "Alice"
- call Sub city="Reykjavik"
- set %unwound% = "yes"
- save %run% to file %where%
